        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Finest Hours, 2016 film adaptation\n- Organizations: United States Coast Guard, Coast Guard Station Chatham\n- Events: T2 tanker rescue, storm\n\nFacts:\n- In 2009, the book The Finest Hours was published.\n- The Finest Hours is about one of the United States Coast Guard's most daring rescues.\n- The rescue in The Finest Hours involved a T2 tanker that broke in two during a storm.\n- The rescue originated from Coast Guard Station Chatham.\n- The 2009 book The Finest Hours inspired a 2016 film adaptation.",
